#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:4
msgid "v3.6.4"
msgstr "v3.6.4"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:6
msgid ""
"v3.6.4 adds an **RTSP video-server** library, fully fixes the **OV5640** "
"imaging modes (Grayscale / RGB565 / Bayer / JPEG at every resolution), "
"doubles sensor FPS with an optimized driver, and fixes a batch of Bayer / "
"JPEG encode bugs. ``image.get_pixel()`` on Bayer images and sensor auto-"
"rotation changed — read the breaking changes below."
msgstr ""
"v3.6.4 dodaje biblioteku **RTSP video-poslužitelja**\\ , potpuno ispravlja "
"načine obrade slike za **OV5640** (sivi tonovi / RGB565 / Bayer / JPEG pri "
"svakoj razlučivosti), udvostručuje FPS senzora optimiziranim upravljačkim "
"programom te ispravlja skup grešaka Bayer / JPEG kodiranja. "
"``image.get_pixel()`` na Bayer slikama i automatska rotacija senzora su "
"promijenjeni — pročitajte promjene koje narušavaju kompatibilnost u "
"nastavku."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Na ovoj stranici"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Najvažnije"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:20
msgid "**RTSP** — a new RTSP video-server library with an example."
msgstr "**RTSP** — nova biblioteka RTSP video-poslužitelja s primjerom."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:21
msgid ""
"**OV5640** — Grayscale / RGB565 / Bayer / JPEG now work at all resolutions, "
"with a larger maximum JPEG transfer and doubled high-res readout."
msgstr ""
"**OV5640** — sivi tonovi / RGB565 / Bayer / JPEG sada rade pri svim "
"razlučivostima, uz veći maksimalni JPEG prijenos i udvostručeno očitavanje "
"visoke razlučivosti."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:23
msgid "**Double FPS** — the sensor driver was optimized for ~2× frame rate."
msgstr ""
"**Dvostruki FPS** — upravljački program senzora je optimiziran za ~2× veću "
"brzinu sličica."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Fixes** — Bayer edge/vflip, software JPEG (1-bpp and YCbCr grayscale), and"
" buffer-overflow issues."
msgstr ""
"**Ispravci** — Bayer rub/vflip, softverski JPEG (1-bpp i YCbCr sivi tonovi) "
"te problemi s preljevom međuspremnika."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Breaking:** ``image.get_pixel()`` now debayers Bayer images and auto-"
"rotation now re-applies on :func:`sensor.reset` — see the breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"**Narušava kompatibilnost:** ``image.get_pixel()`` sada debayerizira Bayer "
"slike, a automatska rotacija se sada ponovno primjenjuje pri "
":func:`sensor.reset` — pogledajte promjene koje narušavaju kompatibilnost."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:31
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nove značajke"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:33
msgid ""
"**RTSP** — added an :mod:`rtsp` library and an ``rtsp_video_server.py`` "
"example for RTSP video streaming."
msgstr ""
"**RTSP** — dodana biblioteka :mod:`rtsp` i primjer ``rtsp_video_server.py`` "
"za RTSP video streaming."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:37
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Ostale promjene i poboljšanja"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:39
msgid ""
"Optimized the sensor driver for roughly double the frame rate, doubled the "
"OV5640 high-resolution readout for Bayer/Grayscale/JPEG, increased the "
"maximum JPEG image transfer size, and updated ``cascade_convert.py`` to work"
" with Python 3."
msgstr ""
"Optimiziran je upravljački program senzora za otprilike dvostruku brzinu "
"sličica, udvostručeno je očitavanje visoke razlučivosti OV5640 za Bayer/sive"
" tonove/JPEG, povećana je maksimalna veličina prijenosa JPEG slike te je "
"``cascade_convert.py`` ažuriran za rad s Pythonom 3."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:45
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Ispravci grešaka"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:47
msgid "Camera and imaging:"
msgstr "Kamera i obrada slike:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:49
msgid ""
"Fixed the OV5640 imaging modes so Grayscale / RGB565 / Bayer / JPEG work "
"correctly at all resolutions, the Bayer vflip on OV7725 / OV7690, the right-"
"edge Bayer conversion error, software JPEG encoding of 1-bpp images and "
"YCbCr grayscale (the −128 subtraction), trailing data on JPEG images, and "
"buffer-overflow issues."
msgstr ""
"Ispravljeni su načini obrade slike OV5640 tako da sivi tonovi / RGB565 / "
"Bayer / JPEG ispravno rade pri svim razlučivostima, Bayer vflip na OV7725 / "
"OV7690, greška Bayer pretvorbe na desnom rubu, softversko JPEG kodiranje "
"1-bpp slika i YCbCr sivih tonova (oduzimanje −128), zaostali podaci na JPEG "
"slikama te problemi s preljevom međuspremnika."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:56
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Promjene API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:58
msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v3.6.3 and v3.6.4. Scope: Python C-modules "
"in ``modules/`` and Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``."
msgstr ""
"Promjene API-ja vidljive korisniku između v3.6.3 i v3.6.4. Opseg: Python "
"C-moduli u ``modules/`` i Python biblioteke u ``scripts/libraries/``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:61
msgid ""
"Both breaking changes are *behavior* changes (same API, different results) —"
" re-check affected scripts. Each commit hash links to its diff on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Obje promjene koje narušavaju kompatibilnost su *behavior* promjene (isti "
"API, drugačiji rezultati) — ponovno provjerite pogođene skripte. Svaki hash "
"commita vodi na svoj diff na GitHubu."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:67
msgid "``image.get_pixel()`` debayers Bayer images *(behavior)*"
msgstr "``image.get_pixel()`` debayerizira Bayer slike *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:69
msgid ""
"``image.get_pixel()`` on a Bayer-format image now debayers and returns an "
"``(r, g, b)`` tuple instead of the raw single-channel Bayer value. Scripts "
"that read raw Bayer values via ``get_pixel()`` will now receive interpolated"
" RGB tuples and must be updated."
msgstr ""
"``image.get_pixel()`` na slici u Bayer formatu sada debayerizira i vraća "
"``(r, g, b)`` n-torku umjesto sirove jednokanalne Bayer vrijednosti. Skripte"
" koje čitaju sirove Bayer vrijednosti putem ``get_pixel()`` sada će primati "
"interpolirane RGB n-torke i moraju se ažurirati."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:74
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `bf16b6a4f <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/bf16b6a4f>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commiti:* `bf16b6a4f <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/bf16b6a4f>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:79
msgid "Auto-rotation re-applies on :func:`sensor.reset` *(behavior)*"
msgstr ""
"Automatska rotacija se ponovno primjenjuje pri :func:`sensor.reset` "
"*(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:81
msgid ""
"Sensor auto-rotation is now (re-)triggered on :func:`sensor.reset`. Scripts "
"that called :func:`sensor.reset` after configuring orientation, expecting "
"rotation state to persist or not re-apply, may see a different orientation "
"and should be re-checked."
msgstr ""
"Automatska rotacija senzora sada se (ponovno) pokreće pri "
":func:`sensor.reset`\\ . Skripte koje su pozivale :func:`sensor.reset` nakon"
" konfiguriranja orijentacije, očekujući da stanje rotacije ostane ili da se "
"ne primijeni ponovno, mogu vidjeti drugačiju orijentaciju i treba ih ponovno"
" provjeriti."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:86
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `0d13a214b <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/0d13a214b>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commiti:* `0d13a214b <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/0d13a214b>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:91
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Kontrolni popis za migraciju"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.4.rst:93
msgid ""
"Update code that read raw Bayer values via ``image.get_pixel()`` to expect "
"an ``(r, g, b)`` tuple (:ref:`the get_pixel change <v3_6_4_getpixel>`), and "
"re-check sensor orientation around :func:`sensor.reset` (:ref:`the auto-"
"rotation change <v3_6_4_autorotation>`). All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Ažurirajte kôd koji je čitao sirove Bayer vrijednosti putem "
"``image.get_pixel()`` da očekuje ``(r, g, b)`` n-torku (\\ :ref:`promjena "
"get_pixel <v3_6_4_getpixel>`\\ ) i ponovno provjerite orijentaciju senzora "
"oko :func:`sensor.reset` (\\ :ref:`promjena automatske rotacije "
"<v3_6_4_autorotation>`\\ ). Sve ostale skripte rade nepromijenjeno."
